## Input

```mlk
// `#[builtin]` on a function that declares a body: what a builtin does is the compiler's, and
// the declaration is what puts its name in the scope of the module, so a body here is a body
// nothing calls.

#[builtin]
fun max(left: Int, right: Int): Int =
    left

